# Skills that `entire agent add --search-skill` / `--agent-help-skill` scaffold
# into agent directories. This repo publishes its skills from skills/, and the
# skills installer also scans .claude/skills, .agents/skills, and similar, so
# committing these would ship duplicates of the search skill to users.
/.*/skills/entire-search/
/.*/skills/entire/
